      "updated": 1792643480997,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  随机 salt（32 字节）\n\n2  predictTokenAddress(\n      账户, salt, name, symbol)\n    离线算出 CREATE2 地址；\n    salt' = keccak256(账户, salt)\n\n3  代币还不存在：按发射时的\n    曲线在本地算首买报价\n    → minOut = 报价 − 5%",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1  随机 salt（32 字节）\n\n2  predictTokenAddress(\n      账户, salt, name, symbol)\n    离线算出 CREATE2 地址；\n    salt' = keccak256(账户, salt)\n\n3  代币还不存在：按发射时的\n    曲线在本地算首买报价\n    → minOut = 报价 − 5%",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.45
    },
